sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Knative Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Istio as Istio Envoy Sidecar<br/>mTLS STRICT
    participant Caikit as Caikit Runtime<br/>(transformer-container)<br/>8085/TCP gRPC · 8080/TCP HTTP
    participant TGIS as TGIS<br/>(kserve-container)<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>9000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Model Inference Request (TGIS-backed)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS 1.2+ SIMPLE
    Gateway->>Istio: Forward request<br/>mTLS STRICT
    Istio->>Caikit: gRPC :8085 or HTTP :8080<br/>mTLS service identity
    Caikit->>TGIS: gRPC inference request<br/>localhost:8033 (no encryption)
    Note right of TGIS: TGIS-AUTO finder<br/>discovers models
    TGIS->>S3: Load model artifacts<br/>S3 API, AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>TGIS: Model weights & config
    TGIS-->>Caikit: Inference result (generated text)
    Caikit-->>Istio: Response
    Istio-->>Gateway: mTLS response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON/gRPC response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Metrics Scraping

    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-user-workload-monitoring)

    Prom->>Caikit: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 8086/TCP<br/>PERMISSIVE mTLS
    Caikit-->>Prom: Caikit runtime metrics
